msgstr ""
";; 现在创建一个包含当前 \"guile\" 包和旧 \"guile-json\" 包的清单。\n"
"(packages->manifest\n"
" (列表 (first (lookup-inferior-packages inferior \"guile-json\"))\n"
"       (specification->package \"guile\")))\n"

