msgstr "Cuirass 服务的类型。它的值必须是一个 @code{cuirass-configuration} 对象，如下所述。"

#. type: cindex
#: guix-git/doc/guix.texi:31257
#, no-wrap
msgid "IRC bouncer configuration for Libera.Chat"
