#: guix-git/doc/guix.texi:35214
#, fuzzy
msgid "Data type representing the configuration of the @code{fcgiwrap} service.  This type has the following parameters:"
msgstr "表示 @code{fcgiwrap} 服务配置的数据类型。该类型具有以下参数："

