"                        (type \"ext4\")))))\n"
msgstr ""
"(service screen-locker-service-type\n"
"         (screen-locker-configuration\n"
"           \"xlock\" (file-append xlockmore \"/bin/xlock\") #f))\n"

#. type: quotation
