#, fuzzy
msgid "These safety checks ensure that you do not inadvertently deploy a system that would fail to boot.  Be careful before turning them off!"
msgstr "这些安全检查确保您不会无意中部署一个无法启动的系统。在关闭它们之前请小心！"

