"    at dl-init.c:118\n"
msgstr ""
"(gdb) bt\n"
"#0  0x00007ffff5f92190 in g_getenv ()\n"
"   from /gnu/store/@dots{}-glib-2.62.6/lib/libglib-2.0.so.0\n"
